contributors (https://github.com/cipansor/crateworks).

The glyph widths and vertical metrics in `src/fonts/metrics.rs` are Adobe's
published AFM metrics for the PDF core fonts, as distributed with Ghostscript
and reproduced in the Python libraries `reportlab` and `pdfminer.six`. The
WinAnsi encoding follows Annex D of the PDF specification (ISO 32000-1).

The declarative document model (content as a value, a table that repeats its
header, page numbers resolved after layout) follows the API of the pdfmake
JavaScript library by Bartek Pampuch and contributors
(https://github.com/bpampuch/pdfmake), which is distributed under the MIT
licence.

This crate is an independent implementation for Rust. It does not include or
link any of those projects.

